{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NOTE: This DLC is primarily for our fellow dwarves who wish to support The Mermaid MenZ developer's small team to continue supporting Bronzebeard's Tavern and support their future game titles!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Say It Without Saying It in Bronzebeard\u2019s Tavern! \ud83e\udd10\ud83d\udca8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Expressive Emotes Mini Pack</strong> brings four new ways to show off your dwarf\u2019s <i>true</i> feelings. Shush the noisy ones, get gobsmacked by something amazing, drop a cheeky fart, or deliver a world-class facepalm\u2014no words needed. Whether you're causing mischief or reacting to it, this pack\u2019s got you covered from stink to stunned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Emote Pack Content\u00a0 \ud83d\udd7a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4x Exclusive Emotes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatchu Talkin'bout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OMG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650660?t=1745226320","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650660?t=1745226320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650660/f10bf782d0ad508e23f71439a6bd0288efa15b00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745226320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650660/f10bf782d0ad508e23f71439a6bd0288efa15b00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745226320","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cl